    en: "some en frases afirmativas (I need some help) y al ofrecer o pedir (Would you like some tea?). any en preguntas y negativas (Do you have any questions? I don't have any money). no = not any (I have no time). Igual: something, anything, nothing; someone, anyone, no one.",
    form: [['Sí', 'There are some apples.', 'Hay unas manzanas.'], ['No', "There isn't any milk.", 'No hay leche.'], ['Pregunta', 'Is there anything to eat?', '¿Hay algo de comer?']],
